{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/1a7d56e6455dded0aecf5f05794ef488.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are thalassophobic, Achluophobic, claustrophobic, batophobic, or even teratophobic, you will be in an underwater <strong>nightmare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/f01b9e0b6f84d5973172046c2b6fd255.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the depths of Gornak and try to repair old underwater facilities <strong>to help the union</strong> and serve your sentence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/970ee505d90005b3de6302d6adb05a79.avif?t=1773308402\" width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/fcd272dbbbed4ead55cfb1a6e73c582d.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will undoubtedly encounter the local fauna... <i>more or less dangerous</i>, but if you pray to Stiska you might find your redemption.. <strong>And even more in our magnificent submarine at the cutting edge of gornak technology !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.poster.avif?t=1773308402\" width=944 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.webm?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/bd78f7e73344a1473e7fe234355b0180.mp4?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/5c730db74956398c6e48712436eff097.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To give you every chance of survival and success, you will come along your companions and pray to not be the last one <strong>drowning </strong>in these deadly waters. However, if you are alone, the Gornacian metallurgical union will help you as best as it can to prevent your death or worse.. The loss of a submarine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.poster.avif?t=1773308402\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.webm?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.mp4?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/e19cc9a8f85319ceeece62567d1397fc.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995260?t=1773308402","background_raw":"https://shared