f survival and success, you will come along your companions and pray to not be the last one <strong>drowning </strong>in these deadly waters. However, if you are alone, the Gornacian metallurgical union will help you as best as it can to prevent your death or worse.. The loss of a submarine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.poster.avif?t=1773308402\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.webm?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.mp4?t=1773308402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/e19cc9a8f85319ceeece62567d1397fc.webp?t=1773308402\" width=450 height=60 /></span></p>","developers":["Nerra Tolsto\u00ef","FLaV"],"dlc":[4319440],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/6744881390d9a00102a849ff6768c8594ea9c3e9/header.jpg?t=1773308402","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 HPTD entertainment. All rights reserved.<br><br>All content included in Depth Diver, as well as all material related to the narrative universe of the project Omesla, is the exclusive property of HPTD Entertainment and is protected under applicable copyright laws, trademark laws, and international intellectual property treaties.<br><br>This include